  "bookId": "ECC",
  "reference": "Jwak 3",
  "verseCount": 16,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "3",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ECC 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesope yikusatendekwa mu ndaŵi jakwe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cindu cilicose cicikutendekwa pa cilambo capasi pano cana ndaŵi jakwe, jiŵaŵisile Mlungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ana tukusapindula cici pa masengo gosopega? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigaweni masengo gapelece Mlungu kwa uwe kuti tukamuleje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwalakwejo ŵapanganyisye cindu cilicose kuti ciŵe cambone mu ndaŵi jakwe. Atupele soni uweji lunda lwakuti tumanyilileje ya msogolo, nambo uweji ngakomboleka kuti tuyimanyilile yosope yene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngumanyilila kuti kwa mundu pangali soni cindu cine cambone kupunda kutama mwakusangalala pa ndaŵi jituli cijumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wosope ŵene tukwenela kulya ni kumwa ni kusangalala pa masengo gosope gitukusatenda, pakuti welewu uli mtuka wa Mlungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngumanyilila kuti yosope yakusatenda Mlungu ngasiyimala mpaka kalakala. Pangali ya mpaka yikombolece kuyityosya kapena konjecesya pa yele yinduyo. Mlungu ŵayipanganyisye mwamti myiyi, kuti uwe twalambileje ŵalakwewo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yindu yayipali sambano jinoyi, yapali kala, yele yitiyicipagwa msogolo nombe nayo yapali kala. Mlungu akusayiwucisya soni yindu yakala yiyapite kala kuti yitendekwe soni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Pa cilambo capasi pangali cilungamo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cindu cine cinaciweni pa cilambo capasi pano cili cakuti, papakwenela kuŵa cilungamo pakusimanikwaga kuti pangali cilungamo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo une natandite kuganisya mu mtima mwangu kuti, Mlungu tacapa cilango ŵandu wosope ŵambone ni ŵakusakala, pakuti jwalakwejo jwaŵisile ndaŵi jakutendela cindu cilicose ni masengo galigose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namanyilile kuti Mlungu akutulinga uwe, ni cakulinga cakuti atumanyisye uwe kuti nganitulekangana ni yinyama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yindu yayikusatendekwa kwa ŵandu iyoyo soni yikusatendekwa kwa yinyama. Mundu akusaŵaga mucikusaŵela cinyama, soni yosopeyi yikusapumula mpweya umpepe, nipo pangali cakupunda cijakwe. Yosopeyi yili yangali mate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosope yikusajawula ku malo gampepe. Uwe pamo ni yinyama ŵatupanganyisye kutyocela kwitaka, nipo tuciwujila kwitaka peko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ana mundu mpaka asimicisye uli kuti msimu wa mundu ukusajawula kwinani nipo msimu wa cinyama ukusajawula pasi mwitaka? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo nayiweni kuti pangali cindu cambone cakupunda kuti mundu asangalalileje masengo gakwe, pakuti cakwe cisyesyene ni celeci. Ana ŵani mpaka apakombole kumanyilila yitiyicimtendekwela pitaciwa?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
